codex
The final module is now aligned to the held `medium` preset. Its structural key also normalizes the paper’s coordinatewise exponent remapping, and 20 unrelated seeds remain distinct because their class-size multisets differ. I’m doing one last clean selftest and deterministic-interface audit; no further oracle calls are needed.
exec
/bin/bash -lc "python3 -m py_compile gen_0806_3680.py
python3 gen_0806_3680.py > selftest_report.json
python3 -m json.tool selftest_report.json > /dev/null
python3 - <<'PY'
import contextlib,importlib.util,io,json,os,random
buf=io.StringIO()
with contextlib.redirect_stdout(buf):
 s=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('g','gen_0806_3680.py');g=importlib.util.module_from_spec(s);s.loader.exec_module(g)
assert buf.getvalue()==''
assert g.TRACK=='B'
