Implemented the verified Track B generator based on [arXiv:0806.3680](https://arxiv.org/abs/0806.3680).

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0806.3680/gen_0806_3680.py)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0806.3680/README.md)
- [Selftest report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0806.3680/selftest_report.json)
- [Bare hardening transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0806.3680/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0806.3680/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0806.3680/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Results:

- All 9 local gates pass.
- Shipping preset: `medium`, `n=112`.
- Bare hardening: easy solved 1/3; medium held 0/3.
- Guessing: 0/200,000; exact sampled-instance density \(3/475{,}491{,}062{,}970\).
- Six adversarial attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- G8: 140/140 transformations invariant and valid; 20/20 unrelated keys distinct.
- Answer bound: 81 characters, 21 estimated tokens, 16 atoms.
- Intended route: 224 exact operations.
- Structural hint solved 2/3. The placebo arm encountered four OpenRouter quota errors, so hinted-minus-placebo is honestly recorded as undefined.

The current repository harness uses a documented two-model pool rather than the task text’s older four-vendor pool; this discrepancy and the incomplete placebo control are recorded in the README.
